{title: I Need Thee Every Hour}
{artist: Annie Hawks / Robert Lowry}
{genre: Hymn}
{flow: Meditative}
{style: Traditional}
{key: G}
{key_original: Ab}
{tempo: 72}
{time: 3/4}
{hymnal: 새찬송가 446장}
{title_ko: 주 음성 외에는}
{score: i-need-thee-every-hour.abc}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[G]I need Thee every [C]hour, most [G]gracious Lord
No [G]tender voice like [D]Thine can peace af[G]ford
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[G]I need Thee, O I need Thee
[C]Every hour I [G]need Thee
O [G]bless me now, my [D]Savior
I [G]come to [D]Thee [G]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[G]I need Thee every [C]hour, stay [G]Thou near by
Temp[G]tations lose their [D]power when Thou art [G]nigh
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[G]I need Thee every [C]hour, in [G]joy or pain
Come [G]quickly and a[D]bide, or life is [G]vain
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[G]I need Thee every [C]hour, teach [G]me Thy will
And [G]Thy rich pro[D]mises in me ful[G]fill
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 5}
[G]I need Thee every [C]hour, most [G]Holy One
O [G]make me Thine in[D]deed, Thou blessed [G]Son
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}
